-1 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/75/i12b13xi6nu3o31dwphrlipg2xm3bxm.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-1_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/75/i12b13xi6nu3o31dwphrlipg2xm3bxm.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%80%92%E5%90%8A%E4%BA%BA%E2%80%9C%E5%85%B5%E8%9C%82%E2%80%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/倒吊人“兵蜂”\"><img alt=\"头像 倒吊人“兵蜂”.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/31/5u7gxie38nvq3m34rusgcctlrgqs9fh.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">倒吊人“兵蜂”</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%B4%A2%E8%8F%B2%E4%BA%9A\" title=\"角色图鉴库/索菲亚\"><img alt=\"头像 索菲亚.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/5a/5m4z2pcn2lh05tblt455hw2r9y18tda.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">索菲亚</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"d